{"id":"registro","lemma":"registro","pos":"noun","rank":1333,"glosses":["registration, record","roll, register, logbook, log","entry (in a register or log)"],"ipa":"/reˈxistɾo/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"registros"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/fc/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-registro.wav","examples":[{"text":"¿A qué hora empiezas el registro?","en":"What time do you start check-in?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/598105"},{"text":"Ella me autorizó a acceder a sus registros.","en":"She gave me access to her records."},{"text":"¿Dónde está la oficina de registro?","en":"Where is the registrar's office?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/598571"},{"text":"El registro empieza a las dos y media.","en":"Registration starts at 2:30.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/302880"},{"text":"El registro de nacimiento de Tom está sellado.","en":"Tom's birth records are sealed.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/801338"}]}